  "keyFeatures": [
    "Phase-aware planning and reporting (POWB, UpKeep, Annual Report) with forward-only data replication",
    "Deliverables management with Open Access and FAIR compliance tracking",
    "Innovation tracking with Scaling Readiness (0–9) scoring",
    "Outcome Impact Case Reports (OICRs) with maturity classification",
    "Structured Quality Assurance workflows with reviewer feedback",
    "Multi-tenant model supporting multiple CRPs, Platforms, and Centers",
    "Business Intelligence integration via Microsoft Fabric (Bronze/Silver/Gold) and Power BI",
    "AI services (Text Mining, Reports Generator, Chatbot) powered by AWS Bedrock",
    "CLARISA integration for reference data (institutions, geography, taxonomy)",
    "Per-program feature flags (specificities) for configurable behavior"
  ],
